    "Renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the period. Manage or cancel in Settings > [your name] > Subscriptions." : {
      "comment" : "UK spelling in the source; US English variant for US users.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
